.SH NAME
niac-config-diff - Compare two configurations


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBniac config diff   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare two NIAC configuration files and show differences.

.PP
Compares:
- Device additions/removals
- Device name changes
- MAC/IP address changes
- Protocol configuration changes


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for diff


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--storage-keep\fP=500
	Run history records to keep, pruned oldest first on start (0 keeps every run)

.PP
\fB--storage-path\fP=""
	Path to NIAC run history database (default: ~/.niac/niac.db)


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  # Compare two configs
  niac config diff prod.yaml staging.yaml

  # Check for drift
  niac config diff baseline.yaml current.yaml

  # Compare before/after changes
  niac config diff config.yaml config.new.yaml
.EE


